# The crossbow by hand (game/archery): no draw, the button raises and aims, letting it go shoots; a weak and a strong
# shooter (the reload by strength, the sway by the weight); lowered loaded and raised again; lowered right after
# a shot and raised again (the next bolt is put in first)
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_01
turn 225
wait 500
equip ItRw_Crossbow_L_01
give ItRw_Bolt 100
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1500 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
stats str 30 dex 30 cbow 30
tap bow
wait 1500
cam follow 220 150 80
cam look 150
wait 300
rec weak
volley 3 300
stop
stats str 120 dex 60 cbow 80
rec strong
volley 3 300
stop
rec lower_loaded
press action
wait 800
press parade
wait 200
release parade
wait 1500
release action
wait 300
press action
wait 1200
release action
wait 2500
stop
# shot, lowered at once (before the reload put the next bolt in), raised again: the bolt is put in first
rec lower_empty
press action
wait 700
release action
wait 100
press parade
wait 150
release parade
wait 600
say RAISE-EMPTY
press action
wait 2500
release action
wait 2500
stop
